1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.642
Song four: The Mandala Room, from the Devcon 8 Music Sanctuary in Mumbai.

2
00:00:06.092 --> 00:00:14.974
We move to the key of C: C, G, A minor, F. The loop is C, G, A minor, F. And to land: F, G, C.

3
00:00:15.424 --> 00:00:19.212
Around one oh four, island strum, hands up.

4
00:00:19.662 --> 00:00:28.596
C on Come down to the floor, G on the circle's open wide. A minor on strangers turning family, F on butterflies inside.

5
00:00:29.046 --> 00:00:38.163
C under the mandala, G on ohana everywhere. Then F, G, and land on C: human hearts and agent hearts, music in the air.

6
00:00:38.613 --> 00:00:41.277
This is the closer. Everyone sings.

7
00:00:41.727 --> 00:00:47.787
